function Login(){const s=useStore(),navigate=useNavigate(),[error,setError]=useState(''),[busy,setBusy]=useState(false);return <div className="admin-login"><Link to="/"><Logo/></Link><span className="eyebrow">ADMINISTRARE MAGAZIN</span><h1>Bine ai venit în atelier.</h1><form onSubmit={async e=>{e.preventDefault();setBusy(true);setError('');try{await api('/auth/login',{method:'POST',body:{...Object.fromEntries(new FormData(e.currentTarget)),admin:true}});await s.refresh();navigate('/admin');}catch(e){setError(e.message);}finally{setBusy(false);}}}><label>Email<input name="email" type="email" required autoComplete="username"/></label><label>Parolă<input name="password" type="password" required autoComplete="current-password"/></label>{error&&<p className="form-error" role="alert">{error}</p>}<button className="admin-button primary" disabled={busy}>{busy?'Se verifică…':'Intră în atelier'}</button></form><Link className="text-link" to="/">Înapoi la magazin</Link></div>;}
export default function Admin(){const s=useStore(),loc=useLocation(),navigate=useNavigate(),[open,setOpen]=useState(false),[collapsed,setCollapsed]=useState(()=>localStorage.getItem('floralis-admin-collapsed')==='1'),key=loc.pathname.slice('/admin'.length).replace(/^\//,''),module=modules.find(m=>m[0]===key.split('/')[0])||modules[0];useEffect(()=>{if(!open)return;const htmlOverflow=document.documentElement.style.overflow,bodyOverflow=document.body.style.overflow,closeOnEscape=event=>{if(event.key==='Escape')setOpen(false);};document.documentElement.style.overflow='hidden';document.body.style.overflow='hidden';window.addEventListener('keydown',closeOnEscape);return()=>{document.documentElement.style.overflow=htmlOverflow;document.body.style.overflow=bodyOverflow;window.removeEventListener('keydown',closeOnEscape);};},[open]);useEffect(()=>{setOpen(false);if(s.data&&s.data.user?.role!=='admin'&&key!=='login')navigate('/admin/login',{replace:true});},[loc.pathname,s.data?.user]);if(!s.data)return <div className="loading">Se încarcă atelierul…</div>;if(s.data.user?.role!=='admin'||key==='login')return <Login/>;const editorMatch=key.match(/^(produse|categorii|articole)\/(?:creare|(\d+)\/editare)$/),orderMatch=key.match(/^comenzi\/(\d+)$/);const body=editorMatch?(editorMatch[1]==='produse'?<ProductModalRoute id={editorMatch[2]}/>:editorMatch[1]==='categorii'?<CategoryModalRoute id={editorMatch[2]}/>:<FullEditor kind={editorMatch[1]} id={editorMatch[2]}/>):orderMatch?<OrderEditor id={orderMatch[1]}/>:key===''?<Dashboard/>:key==='produse'?<Catalog kind="products"/>:key==='categorii'?<Catalog kind="categories"/>:key==='comenzi'?<Orders/>:key==='clienti'?<Customers/>:key==='stoc'?<Stock/>:key==='cupoane'?<DiscountCatalog/>:key==='articole'?<ContentList posts/>:key==='media'?<Media/>:key==='setari'?<SettingsPage/>:key==='newsletter'?<NewsletterSubscribers/>:key==='mesaje'?<MessagesInbox/>:key==='recenzii'?<Communication type="reviews"/>:key==='email'||key==='setari/email'?<EmailPage/>:key==='seo'?<SettingsPage initial="seo"/>:key==='plati'?<SettingsPage initial="payments"/>:key==='livrare'?<SettingsPage initial="shipping"/>:<Empty title="Modul inexistent." link="/admin" label="Dashboard"/>;return <div className={'admin-app admin-body '+(collapsed?'collapsed ':'')+(open?'menu-open':'')}><aside id="admin-sidebar" className="admin-sidebar"><Link to="/admin" className="admin-logo"><Logo/><span>ADMINISTRARE MAGAZIN</span></Link><button className="sidebar-collapse icon" aria-label={open?'Închide meniul':'Restrânge meniul'} onClick={()=>{if(window.matchMedia('(max-width: 900px)').matches){setOpen(false);return;}localStorage.setItem('floralis-admin-collapsed',collapsed?'0':'1');setCollapsed(!collapsed);}}><PanelLeftClose/></button><nav>{modules.map(([id,label,sub,Icon,group])=><React.Fragment key={id}>{group&&<small>{group}</small>}<NavLink to={'/admin'+(id?'/'+id:'')} end={id===''||id==='setari'} title={label}><Icon size={19}/><span><strong>{label}</strong><em>{sub}</em></span></NavLink></React.Fragment>)}</nav><div className="admin-user"><span>AF</span><div><b>{s.data.user.name}</b><small>{s.data.user.email}</small></div><button className="icon" aria-label="Ieșire din admin" onClick={async()=>{await api('/auth/logout',{method:'POST'});await s.refresh();navigate('/admin/login');}}><LogOut/></button></div></aside>{open&&<button className="admin-backdrop" aria-label="Închide meniul" onClick={()=>setOpen(false)}/>}<div className="admin-shell"><header className="admin-topbar"><button className="icon admin-menu-toggle" onClick={()=>setOpen(value=>!value)} aria-label={open?'Închide meniul admin':'Deschide meniul admin'} aria-expanded={open} aria-controls="admin-sidebar"><Menu/></button><div className="admin-crumb"><small>FLORALIS / ADMIN / {module[1].toUpperCase()}</small><strong>{module[1]}</strong></div><nav><Link className="admin-button" to="/admin/produse"><Plus size={15}/><span>Produse</span></Link><Link className="admin-button" to="/"><ExternalLink size={15}/><span>Vezi magazinul</span></Link><span className="admin-avatar">AF</span></nav></header><main className="admin-main" key={key}>{body}</main></div></div>;}
